    "title": "(AMZN-NLN) Soundpeats Sonic Bluetooth 5.2 Wireless Earphones QCC3040 Chipset APTX-adaptive CVC 8.0 Noise Reduction Earbuds 45H Play time (Gray)",
    "body_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-mce-style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff2a00;\"><strong><span>\u00a0</span><span>As our store also sell on amazon, we do receive returns from the customers by stating reason as \"No longer needed\" called as AMZN-NLN. The products sold in this collection are UNUSED, in almost new - 100% working condition. So, here is an opportunity for our customers to experience the best at deeply discounted prices :)</span></strong></span>\u00a0</p>\n<div class=\"detailmodule_dynamic\"><widget data-widget-type=\"customText\" id=\"1005000000192869\" title=\"\" type=\"custom\"></widget></div>\n<div class=\"detailmodule_html\">\n<div class=\"detail-desc-decorate-richtext\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\" data-mce-style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\" data-mce-style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 22px;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 22px;\"><span times=\"\" roman=\"\" new=\"\">Soundpeats Sonic Bluetooth 5.2 Wireless Earphones QCC3040 Chipset APTX-adaptive CVC 8.0 Noise Reduction Earbuds 45H Play time</span></span></strong></div>\n<div>\u00a0</div>\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 18px; color: #111111; padding: 0px;\" class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\" data-mce-style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 18px; color: #111111; padding: 0px;\" ember=\"\" amazon=\"\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\" data-mce-style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span times=\"\" roman=\"\" new=\"\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" class=\"a-list-item\" data-mce-style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong>[Bluetooth 5.2 &amp; QCC3040 Chipset]</strong>- Adopt advanced Bluetooth 5.2 and built-in high-tech QCC 3040 chipset, SoundPEATS Sonic is compatible with all the Bluetooth devices enable with bluetooth 4.0 or above and provides you truly wireless enjoyment with seamless connection and lower consumption. You can choose either earbud at a time for calls or music, switch freely between single and twin mode.</span></span></span></li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\" data-mce-style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span times=\"\" roman=\"\" new=\"\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" class=\"a-list-item\" data-mce-style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong>[Immersive Bass &amp; Clear Call]</strong>- To bring you a unparalleled audio feast, SoundPEATS Sonic wireless earbuds adopt low frequency enhancement technology and latest aptx-adaptive audio decoding technology to deliver fantastic immersive sound with powerful bass. Combined with Qualcomm CVC noise reduction functionality, you\u2019ll experience a whole new world of crystal-clear phone calls.</span></span></span></li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\" data-mce-style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span times=\"\" roman=\"\" new=\"\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" class=\"a-list-item\" data-mce-style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong>[35 Hrs Playtime &amp; USB-C Charge]</strong>- Taking with SoundPEATS Sonic bluetooth earbuds, you can enjoy music wherever you go as it offers up to 15 hours playtime on a single full charge and pocket sized charging case extends playtime up to 35 hours and supports up to 2 full charges for the earbuds, it only takes 1.5 hrs to charge the case with type-C quick charge.</span></span></span></li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\" data-mce-style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span times=\"\" roman=\"\" new=\"\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" class=\"a-list-item\" data-mce-style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong>[TrueWireless Mirroring &amp; Game Mode]</strong>- The advanced TrueWireless Mirroring teconology aims to maximize the connection stability and reduce the audio interruption under the poor radio frequency circumstance, you will feel no signal loss or music dropouts during listening and calling no matter indoor or outdoor. The game mode minimizes the delay to ensure the synchronization of the game audio and picture (Triple tap MFB on left earbud to enter the Game mode).</span></span></span></li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\" data-mce-style=\"box-sizing: border-box; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span times=\"\" roman=\"\" new=\"\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" class=\"a-list-item\" data-mce-style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong>[Easy Control &amp; Comfortable Fit]</strong>- Compared to the smart touch control, the sensitive button control provides more precise control for what you want. Softly tap on the earbud to skip songs, adjust volume, answer/reject calls and activate siri without picking up your phone. In-ear ergonomic design and three different sizes of eartips brings you most comfortable wearing.</span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<div>\u00a0</div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span times=\"\" roman=\"\" new=\"\"><strong>Specification:</strong></span></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span times=\"\" roman=\"\" new=\"\">1.Sensitivity: 94\u00b13dB</span></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span times=\"\" roman=\"\" new=\"\">2.Resistance: 16\u03a9</span></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span times=\"\" roman=\"\" new=\"\">3.Frequency Response Range: 20-20000Hz</span></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span times=\"\" roman=\"\" new=\"\">4.Codecs: SBC\u3001 APTX\u3001 APTX-adaptive</span></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span times=\"\" roman=\"\" new=\"\">5.Active Noise-Cancellation: No</span></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span times=\"\" roman=\"\" new=\"\">6.Bluetooth Version: Bluetooth 5.2</span></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span times=\"\" roman=\"\" new=\"\">7.Bluetooth Prole: HSP \u3001HFP \u3001 A2DP\u3001AVRCP</span></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span times=\"\" roman=\"\" new=\"\">8.Bluetooth Chipset: QCC3040</span></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span times=\"\" roman=\"\" new=\"\">9.Maximun Working Range: 33feet/10m(no abstacle)</span></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span times=\"\" roman=\"\" new=\"\">10.Playing Time: About 15 Hours (volume at 60%)</span></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span times=\"\" roman=\"\" new=\"\">11.Earbuds Charging Time: About 1.5 hours</span></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span times=\"\" roman=\"\" new=\"\">12.Case Charging Time: 1.5 Hours</span></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span times=\"\" roman=\"\" new=\"\">13.Charging Case Recharge Earbuds: 2 times</span></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span times=\"\" roman=\"\" new=\"\">14.Earbud Power Capacity: 70mah</span></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span times=\"\" roman=\"\" new=\"\">15.Charging Case Power Capacity: 400mah</span></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span times=\"\" roman=\"\" new=\"\">16.Earbud Dimension(L*W*H): 0.72*0.8*1.07in/18.3*20.5*27.2mm</span></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span times=\"\" roman=\"\" new=\"\">17.Charging Case Dimension(L*W*H): 61*38.95*34.71mm</span></span></div>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H5c1d2d4158a44945895e0bd0bab85040x.jpg\" alt=\"1\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Hc92a98d274c743f3b650f46322f4467c4.jpg\" alt=\"2\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/Hf8193dd0519240679abc28b3ef101064K.jpg\" alt=\"3\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H4d1cbcdf01fa4ec58ed943d9ff1bacd9q.jpg\" alt=\"4\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H4264c457b08645c781b2175bfd7e20f0Y.jpg\" alt=\"5\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/H9c27c3d107544cb38c0955c8e20ac3f2b.jpg\" alt=\"425\"></p>\n</div>\n</div>",
